@title badge on a surface
# Made by svgsurf from badge.svg: each colour region is cut into strips that are exact in (u,v),
# each a parametric surface lifted a little above the surface srfx, srfy, srfz along its unit normal nrmx, nrmy, nrmz.
srfx(u,v)=2*sin(v)*cos(u)
srfy(u,v)=2*sin(v)*sin(u)
srfz(u,v)=2*cos(v)
nrmx(u,v)=sin(v)*cos(u)
nrmy(u,v)=sin(v)*sin(u)
nrmz(u,v)=cos(v)
surface(srfx(u,v),srfy(u,v),srfz(u,v),v,0,3.14159265,u,-3.14159265,3.14159265) | color=#d9d4c7
